# What we really think at drum class

Ok, so here is a brief on what our students may think through out a drum class. It's true, it's funny and it's definitely how a drum class with Nathaniel on Tuesday night plays out! It's interesting that both experienced and beginner drummers are on a similar note and even more interesting that it happens at the same time to the minute.... ;) Well, OK maybe it's not all entirely true...we just go by facial expressions :) [![drum class](/media/2015/07/what-we-really-think-at-class...new-times1-1.jpg)](/media/2015/07/what-we-really-think-at-class...new-times1-1.jpg)
